1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,370
A clash of blades

3
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,120
is merely a contest between mortals.

4
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,080
The heavens created mankind,

5
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,370
shaping them from clay.

6
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,080
To achieve immortality,

7
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,080
one must shed the mortal form

8
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,500
and become refined porcelain.

9
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:12,500
Master Lu?

10
00:01:13,450 --> 00:01:15,120
What did you do to her?

11
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:17,660
Lu Yuanqing.

12
00:01:18,330 --> 00:01:20,910
Hand over the ice silkworm.

13
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:22,830
She

14
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,349
can only be mine.

15
00:01:25,391 --> 00:01:27,470
=Episode 10=
(She Can Only Be Mine)

16
00:01:43,290 --> 00:01:44,910
He refined a twin manifestation,

17
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:48,160
turning the silkworm monster Lu Ji
into part of himself.

18
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:49,790
He's insane.

19
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:49,080
Mere mortals

20
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:51,040
could never harm me.

21
00:03:28,370 --> 00:03:30,580
His porcelain armor cannot be broken
from the outside.

22
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,080
Then what do we do?

23
00:03:35,410 --> 00:03:36,790
(It's Master Lu's ice silkworm.)

24
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:43,330
This is a fragment of my

25
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:45,410
spiritual consciousness

26
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:47,080
left inside the ice silkworm.

27
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:50,870
I know

28
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,910
you are bound to reach
this point someday.

29
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,870
To face him.

30
00:03:55,870 --> 00:03:57,120
Just like you,

31
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,750
he emerged from the Ice Lake

32
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:02,580
and fought his way to the Upper City.

33
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,000
(Ten Years Ago)

34
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,120
The Medicine Lodge
is giving out porridge

35
00:04:05,450 --> 00:04:07,290
to aid those suffering on the journey.

36
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:09,870
All travelers are welcome.

37
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:12,160
Line up and take your share.

38
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:15,200
Thank you.

39
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:25,790
Move!

40
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:28,250
You're this skinny
and still haven't starved?

41
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,660
The Essence-Nourishing Porridge is
for those entering the Ascension Trial.

42
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:33,120
It's wasted on you.

43
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:36,580
You want to pick up the bowl too?

44
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:39,330
Go on, pick it up!

45
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:41,200
The Medicine Lodge gives porridge
without asking where people come from.

46
00:04:41,370 --> 00:04:42,410
Without lining up,

47
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:44,290
you get nothing.

48
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,660
Go. Go.

49
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,979
Mr. Bai.

50
00:05:12,021 --> 00:05:14,620
Your disciple has reached
the right age, hasn't she?

51
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:18,160
All the young men in my place
are preparing for the Ascension Trial.

52
00:05:18,410 --> 00:05:19,499
Let her take a look.

53
00:05:19,541 --> 00:05:20,729
She can take a look at our boys.

54
00:05:20,771 --> 00:05:21,950
See if any catches her eye.

55
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,750
I'm worried about that too.

56
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:29,120
Ask her yourself.

57
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,080
She...

58
00:05:31,410 --> 00:05:33,750
Whoever can retrieve the Reverse Scale
from the Ice Lake,

59
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,120
I'll marry him.

60
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:36,620
Ice Lake?

61
00:05:36,910 --> 00:05:38,450
Our bones would melt away
the moment we enter.

62
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:39,580
Master Lu,

63
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:41,119
this isn't a marriage proposal.

64
00:05:41,161 --> 00:05:42,870
You're asking people to die.

65
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:46,750
Then it means you aren't capable
of marrying me.

66
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:11,450
Who is there?

67
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:20,540
The Ice Lake...

68
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:22,200
I went there.

69
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:25,429
And Cang and Yi...

70
00:06:25,471 --> 00:06:26,750
I defeated them too.

71
00:06:28,250 --> 00:06:30,040
But the Reverse Scale was frozen.

72
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,370
I couldn't take it out.

73
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:39,500
Master!

74
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,750
Master!

75
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:57,500
Here, drink this medicine.

76
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,620
You're really foolish.

77
00:07:10,410 --> 00:07:11,349
Once my wounds heal,

78
00:07:11,391 --> 00:07:12,500
I'll go again.

79
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,500
Go where?

80
00:07:15,910 --> 00:07:16,790
To the Ice Lake.

81
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,700
I'll definitely bring it back.

82
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,370
I was just saying that.

83
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,410
I'm serious.

84
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:36,120
Your heart meridian is injured.

85
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:38,429
If my master hadn't used
the fire silkworm to mend it,

86
00:07:38,471 --> 00:07:39,370
you would already be dead.

87
00:07:39,660 --> 00:07:40,410
I know.

88
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:42,830
Next time,

89
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,950
I'll be stronger.

90
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,700
Lie down.

91
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,580
You are not allowed to go to
the Ice Lake again.

92
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,450
Do you really have to leave?

93
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,540
Once I make a name for myself,

94
00:08:10,910 --> 00:08:12,290
I'll bring you to the Capital.

95
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:13,580
To the Upper City

96
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,830
to see the lanterns.

97
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:19,830
But half-monsters are forbidden
from entering the Upper City.

98
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:21,660
If I win,

99
00:08:21,910 --> 00:08:23,580
I'll change this stupid rule.

100
00:08:23,910 --> 00:08:26,660
I'll let all half-monsters
enter the capital freely.

101
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,330
They can go wherever they want

102
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:30,250
and never have to bow to anyone again.

103
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:50,160
This is the ice silkworm inside me.

104
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:53,540
The fire silkworm mended
into your heart meridian is its twin.

105
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:58,160
My master said twin silkworms
can connect our hearts

106
00:08:58,500 --> 00:08:59,620
and share our spiritual consciousness.

107
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,120
So,

108
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:05,929
our hearts are bound together.

109
00:09:05,971 --> 00:09:06,700
Right?

110
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,200
Wait for me.

111
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:12,200
I will come back for you.

112
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:29,000
Then

113
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,450
did he come back?

114
00:09:32,950 --> 00:09:33,700
He...

115
00:09:35,700 --> 00:09:36,750
He came back.

116
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:40,179
But the person he once was

117
00:09:40,221 --> 00:09:41,200
is dead.

118
00:09:43,830 --> 00:09:45,080
(I promised you)

119
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:46,950
(I would take you to the Capital.)

120
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:50,409
(Ride my carriage into the city.)

121
00:09:50,451 --> 00:09:51,329
(No one will dare stop you,)

122
00:09:51,371 --> 00:09:52,500
(nor question you.)

123
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:01,179
(Okay. I'll go to the Capital with you,)

124
00:10:01,221 --> 00:10:02,080
(what about them?)

125
00:10:03,330 --> 00:10:04,200
(What?)

126
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:06,290
(What are those Porcelain
Armored Soldiers outside for?)

127
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:08,309
(They...)

128
00:10:08,351 --> 00:10:09,370
(Don't lie to me.)

129
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:14,410
(Has the rule forbidding half-monsters
from entering the Upper City)

130
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:15,160
(changed?)

131
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:17,910
(I just became Lord
of the Heavenly Law.)

132
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:20,080
(In the Capital, I walk on thin ice.)

133
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:22,410
(I cannot let them know who you are.)

134
00:10:23,660 --> 00:10:25,370
(The half-monsters, exiled criminals
and escaped slaves)

135
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:27,450
(in the Medicine Lodge)

136
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:28,790
(must all be dealt with.)

137
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:35,790
(You are no longer foolish.)

138
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:37,179
(I did all this for you.)

139
00:10:37,221 --> 00:10:38,580
(You still don't understand.)

140
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:40,750
(I told you.)

141
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,500
(The man I marry)

142
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,950
(must be the one who can retrieve
the Reverse Scale.)

143
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:56,540
(Master.)

144
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:59,620
(He lost his way in the Capital.)

145
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:03,040
He never found his way back.

146
00:11:05,450 --> 00:11:07,830
To reach the Divine Sovereign Realm
through the power of heavenly thunder,

147
00:11:08,330 --> 00:11:09,729
step by step,

148
00:11:09,771 --> 00:11:11,450
he killed the person he used to be.

149
00:11:13,330 --> 00:11:15,450
But he has not fully achieved it yet.

150
00:11:15,950 --> 00:11:17,830
You still have a chance to stop him.

151
00:11:18,950 --> 00:11:20,950
How can I break through his armor?

152
00:11:21,830 --> 00:11:23,849
The ice silkworm within you

153
00:11:23,891 --> 00:11:25,330
and the fire silkworm within him

154
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:27,950
share a Twin Bond.

155
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:30,200
They can connect
your spiritual consciousness.

156
00:11:31,450 --> 00:11:33,179
Enter the realm
of his spiritual consciousness

157
00:11:33,221 --> 00:11:34,700
and find his cultivating
primordial spirit.

158
00:11:34,950 --> 00:11:36,330
Destroy that primordial spirit,

159
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,160
and his shield armor

160
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:40,000
will collapse on its own.

161
00:11:40,580 --> 00:11:42,200
I can send you inside.

162
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,540
I'll enter his consciousness
and take a look.

163
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,120
(Who is the Challenger?)

164
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:05,410
(Dazedi.)

165
00:12:05,700 --> 00:12:06,120
(Wang Yan.)

166
00:12:06,410 --> 00:12:07,660
(Life and death shall be disregarded!)

167
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:08,910
(Begin the battle!)

168
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,999
(The Challenger wins.)

169
00:12:11,041 --> 00:12:15,000
(Dare you enter and face
your truest desire?)

170
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,040
(By divine decree,)

171
00:12:16,330 --> 00:12:18,080
(you are hereby appointed Lord
of the Heavenly Law,)

172
00:12:18,370 --> 00:12:19,830
(overseeing the affairs
of the Heavenly Law Bureau.)

173
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:23,000
(May you uphold justice, fulfill
your duties, and serve with devotion.)

174
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,830
(My greetings,
Lord of the Heavenly Law.)

175
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,580
(The Medicine Lodge
is full of corruption.)

176
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:30,080
(It should have been cleansed long ago.)

177
00:12:36,410 --> 00:12:38,370
(You gave him the ice silkworm?)

178
00:12:57,330 --> 00:12:58,450
You said

179
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,410
that our hearts

180
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:02,620
were bound by a Twin Bond.

181
00:13:02,870 --> 00:13:04,120
Am I right?

182
00:13:10,870 --> 00:13:11,750
This way,

183
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:15,830
you will never leave me again.

184
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:35,750
Why

185
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,080
would you do this to Master Lu?

186
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:43,830
Because of you!

187
00:13:50,330 --> 00:13:51,580
You should never have
gone to the Ice Lake!

188
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:03,500
You should never have taken
the Reverse Scale!

189
00:14:07,750 --> 00:14:09,120
And she should never have given you
the ice silkworm!

190
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:18,660
Both the Reverse Scale and her
should belong to me!

191
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:21,540
You're insane.

192
00:14:36,660 --> 00:14:38,429
You think you're any different from me?

193
00:14:38,471 --> 00:14:40,370
You fought your way here,
killing your way forward.

194
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:43,099
You stand here

195
00:14:43,141 --> 00:14:44,500
because you were stronger than them.

196
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:45,429
This world

197
00:14:45,471 --> 00:14:47,370
has always been ruled by the strong
over the weak.

198
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:48,849
The Reverse Scale chose you.

199
00:14:48,891 --> 00:14:49,849
She chose you too.

200
00:14:49,891 --> 00:14:51,200
It's only because you won.

201
00:14:51,370 --> 00:14:52,620
Now she is with me

202
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,250
because I am stronger than you.

203
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,519
If you think you're capable,

204
00:14:56,561 --> 00:14:57,450
come and take her.

205
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:21,979
(Back then,)

206
00:15:22,021 --> 00:15:23,410
(his heart meridian
was severely wounded.)

207
00:15:24,250 --> 00:15:25,700
(Though the fire silkworm
repaired the wound,)

208
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:29,250
(he still carried a hidden weakness
in his chest.)

209
00:15:29,870 --> 00:15:31,580
(That is his only weakness.)

210
00:15:35,450 --> 00:15:37,040
Let me end this.

211
00:15:37,370 --> 00:15:38,910
Heavenly Thunder of the Divine
Sovereign Realm,

212
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,540
All Thunder Returns!

213
00:16:44,450 --> 00:16:47,330
This world has never been about
the strong ruling over the weak.

214
00:16:48,830 --> 00:16:50,700
She left a spiritual consciousness
within the ice silkworm.

215
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:52,580
Before it faded away,

216
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,370
the last person she wanted to see...

217
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:58,500
was you.

218
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:11,929
(The Medicine Lodge
is giving out porridge)

219
00:17:11,971 --> 00:17:13,830
(to aid those suffering on the journey.)

220
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:16,330
(All travelers are welcome.)

221
00:17:16,950 --> 00:17:18,450
(Line up and take your share.)

222
00:17:24,250 --> 00:17:24,660
(Hey.)

223
00:17:25,330 --> 00:17:26,160
(Your turn.)

224
00:17:52,870 --> 00:17:54,250
(I have been waiting for you all along.)

225
00:17:58,450 --> 00:17:59,950
(I gave you a bowl of porridge,)

226
00:18:00,950 --> 00:18:02,750
(not so that you would give me
the entire Capital.)

227
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,660
(It's a pity you never understood me.)

228
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:22,790
(It was me...)

229
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,540
(I was the one who was wrong.)

230
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:29,660
(It's alright.)

231
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:32,790
(The Capital is too vast.)

232
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:35,200
(You simply lost your way.)

233
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:39,450
(Whoever can retrieve the Reverse Scale
from the Ice Lake,)

234
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:40,540
(I will marry him.)

235
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:42,620
(You are not allowed to go to
the Ice Lake again.)

236
00:18:43,660 --> 00:18:44,750
(I was just saying that.)

237
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:46,750
(Do you really have to leave?)

238
00:18:55,330 --> 00:18:56,330
(Hey.)

239
00:18:56,620 --> 00:18:58,200
(You're really foolish.)

240
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:11,499
This is...

241
00:19:11,541 --> 00:19:13,160
"A silkworm's thread ends
only when it dies."

242
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,999
The silkworm monster's life has ended,

243
00:19:16,041 --> 00:19:17,659
but if regrets remain in its heart,

244
00:19:17,701 --> 00:19:19,120
and unfinished threads remain,

245
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:21,750
it will form a cocoon,

246
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:23,479
waiting to break free again,

247
00:19:23,521 --> 00:19:24,349
to become human,

248
00:19:24,391 --> 00:19:25,410
and gain consciousness.

249
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:28,750
But no one knows how long it will take.

250
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:31,450
It may be ten years.

251
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,620
Or it may be a lifetime.

252
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:39,330
She waited for me her entire life.

253
00:19:42,290 --> 00:19:43,450
I will wait for her too.

254
00:20:11,770 --> 00:20:14,350
(Come home, lost child.)

255
00:20:32,450 --> 00:20:33,950
(The path to Yuyou Village)

256
00:20:34,450 --> 00:20:37,200
(has only ever been opened by the Lord
of the Heavenly Law throughout history.)

257
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:39,910
Thank you.

258
00:20:40,290 --> 00:20:41,120
No need.

259
00:20:41,700 --> 00:20:43,540
This is a path you carved yourself.

260
00:20:45,950 --> 00:20:47,370
What will you do now?

261
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,500
I will leave the heavens

262
00:20:50,620 --> 00:20:52,330
and walk back down to the mortal world.

263
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,160
Your little sister knows you're here.

264
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,370
She is waiting for you.

265
00:21:21,790 --> 00:21:23,160
Mortal sinner.

266
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:25,429
How dare you trespass into
the forbidden grounds of Yuyou Village.

267
00:21:25,471 --> 00:21:27,849
I have led the Heavenwrights here
to uphold the heavenly order.

268
00:21:27,891 --> 00:21:30,620
If you wish to go up,
you must first get past us.

269
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:32,790
That's right. Get past us first!

270
00:21:32,910 --> 00:21:33,500
Exactly!

271
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:35,700
Well said!
